  "criteria": [
    {"id":"AC1","text":"Refused, nonbusy not-run and unknown checks say \"no verdict\" instead of a cross on Story and overall summary lines."},
    {"id":"AC2","text":"A failed check keeps the cross even when another check has no verdict; all passed checks keep the tick."},
    {"id":"AC3","text":"Queued or running checks keep \"running\" when none failed; \"busy\" appears when every row passed or is actually busy and at least one is busy, and stale busy flags cannot hide another no-verdict check."},
    {"id":"AC4","text":"JSON keeps a refused check's refusal cause and the server explanation and next step on refused, not-run and unknown checks."}
  ],
